<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SOCCER-CZECH REPUBLIC BEAT POLAND 2-1 IN FRIENDLY INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CZECH REPUBLIC BEAT POLAND 2-1 IN FRIENDLY INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>OSTRAVA, Czech Republic 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech</p>
<p>Republic beat Poland 2-1 (halftime 1-0) in a friendly soccer</p>
<p>international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Czech Republic - Pavel Kuka 21, Karel Rada 63</p>
<p>Poland - Jacek Zielinski 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,817</p>
</text>
